@startuml View Class Post by User
actor User
participant ": ClassDetailPage " as ClassDetailPage
participant ": TeacherPosts " as TeacherPosts
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": PostController " as PostController
participant ": PostService " as PostService
participant ": PostRepository " as PostRepository
database Database

User->ClassDetailPage: 1. Navigate to Class Detail Page
    activate User
    activate ClassDetailPage

ClassDetailPage->ClassDetailPage: 2. Render Class Detail Page

ClassDetailPage->TeacherPosts: 3. Render TeacherPosts Component
    activate TeacherPosts
    deactivate ClassDetailPage

TeacherPosts->Router: 4. Send GET /api/post/classgroup/{id}
    deactivate TeacherPosts
    activate Router

Router->PostController: 5. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate PostController

PostController->PostController: 6. GetAppUserAndThrow() - Get current user
    activate PostController

PostController->PostService: 7. GetPostsByClassGroup(classGroupId, user)
    deactivate PostController
    activate PostService

PostService->PostService: 8. Call GetPostsCore with filter

PostService->PostRepository: 9. GetAllPostIncluding()
    activate PostRepository

PostRepository->Database: 10. Query Posts with User, Attachments, Comments, Likes, Hashtags
    activate Database

Database-->PostRepository: 11. Return Posts with relations
    deactivate Database

PostRepository-->PostService: 12. Return Posts query
    deactivate PostRepository

PostService->PostService: 13. Filter by ClassGroupId and !IsDeleted

PostService->PostService: 14. Sort by CreatedAt (newest first)

PostService->PostService: 15. Map to PostResponseDto with User info, Attachments, LikeCount, IsLikedByCurrentUser

PostService-->PostController: 16. Return PostResponseDto[]
    activate PostController
    deactivate PostService

PostController->PostController: 17. Wrap in ResponseDto

PostController-->Router: 18. Send Posts Response
    activate Router
    deactivate PostController

Router-->TeacherPosts: 19. Display Posts List
    activate TeacherPosts
    deactivate Router

TeacherPosts->TeacherPosts: 20. Update posts state

TeacherPosts->TeacherPosts: 21. Render PostCard components

TeacherPosts-->User: 22. Show Class Posts
    deactivate TeacherPosts
    deactivate User
@enduml





